{"id":"1605348998008623104","date":"2022-12-20","url":"https://x.com/adamdangelo/status/1605348998008623104","author":"adamdangelo","text":"Poe will initially be available on iOS, and it will be invite only until we work out scalability, get feedback from beta testers, and address any other issues that come up. After we get through this phase, we will open up to everyone and add support for all platforms.","reply_to":"adamdangelo","live_status":200,"archived_at":"20230125194021","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230125194021/https://twitter.com/adamdangelo/status/1605348998008623104?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
{"id":"1605348996590862336","date":"2022-12-20","url":"https://x.com/adamdangelo/status/1605348996590862336","author":"adamdangelo","text":"Today we are starting a beta test for a new product called Poe. Short for \"Platform for Open Exploration\", it lets people ask questions, get instant answers, and have back-and-forth dialogue with AI.","live_status":200,"archived_at":"20230120233806","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230120233806/https://twitter.com/adamdangelo/status/1605348996590862336","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
{"id":"1549150857630928896","date":"2022-07-18","url":"https://x.com/adamdangelo/status/1549150857630928896","author":"adamdangelo","text":"I’m excited to welcome Mariana Garavaglia to the Quora board. Mariana is currently Chief Business and People Officer at Relativity Space, and we are looking forward to her counsel as we continue on our path toward our mission to share and grow the world’s knowledge.","live_status":200,"archived_at":"20220720101258","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220720101258/https://twitter.com/adamdangelo/status/1549150857630928896","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
